                        FORM OF THE SPIDER
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'There is much power in ones deadly bite.'|WK0 - |RKBMaster Dwan Kang
|YK0
Graceful, agile, reviled. The Spider is a creature of many
mysteries, who is able to throw itself, trap and kill its
its foe.

This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Spider.

These powers are: |GKBSpider Leap|YK0, |GKBSpider Bite|YK0, |GKBSpider Burrow|YK0, |GKBWeb|YK0
and |GKBMend|YK0.
